<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>About KAIZEN — AI Trading Discipline Mentor</title>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/feather-icons/4.29.0/feather.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="app-page">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 80px;">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:60px 0 48px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:48px;">
      <div style="
        font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
        font-size:0.62rem;
        letter-spacing:0.25em;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        color:var(--gold);
        margin-bottom:20px;
        display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;
      ">
        <span style="width:32px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);display:inline-block;"></span>
        The Mission
        <span style="width:32px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);display:inline-block;"></span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="
        font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.5rem);
        font-weight:700;
        color:var(--text-primary);
        line-height:1.05;
        margin-bottom:20px;
      ">About <span style="color:var(--gold);">KAIZEN</span></h1>
      <p style="
        font-size:1rem;
        color:var(--text-secondary);
        max-width:560px;
        margin:0 auto;
        line-height:1.85;
      ">
        Built by a trader, for traders. KAIZEN exists because the gap between
        knowing your rules and following them is where most accounts go to die.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:48px;">
      <div style="
        background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(248,113,113,0.05),rgba(201,168,76,0.03));
        border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.15);
        padding:36px;
        position:relative;
        overflow:hidden;
      ">
        <div style="
          position:absolute;top:0;right:0;
          width:120px;height:120px;
          background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(248,113,113,0.06),transparent 70%);
        "></div>
        <div style="
          font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
          font-size:0.6rem;
          letter-spacing:0.2em;
          text-transform:uppercase;
          color:#F87171;
          margin-bottom:16px;
          display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
        ">
          <i data-feather="alert-triangle" width="14" height="14"></i>
          The Problem
        </div>
        <div style="
          font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.8rem);
          font-weight:700;
          color:var(--text-primary);
          line-height:1.1;
          margin-bottom:16px;
        ">80-90% of retail traders<br>lose money.</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;max-width:560px;margin:0;">
          Not because of bad strategies. Not because of the market.
          Because of behavioral failures, FOMO entries, revenge trades,
          rule violations under pressure, and overconfidence after wins.
          The strategy works. The execution does not.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- THE SOLUTION -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:48px;">
      <div style="
        font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
        font-size:0.6rem;
        letter-spacing:0.2em;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        color:var(--gold);
        margin-bottom:20px;
        display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
      ">
        <i data-feather="cpu" width="14" height="14"></i>
        The Solution
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.15;">
        An AI that learns how<br>you trade, specifically.
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:28px;">
        KAIZEN analyzes your free-text journal entries against your own stated rules
        and your full session history. Every response is specific to your behavior,
        your patterns, your triggers, your blind spots. Not a template. Not generic advice.
        A mentor that builds a profile of how you trade and uses it to make you better.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;">
        The Discipline Score measures your process consistency not your profit and loss.
        Because consistent process is the only thing that creates consistent profit.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- THREE PILLARS -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:48px;">
      <div style="
        font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
        font-size:0.6rem;
        letter-spacing:0.2em;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        color:var(--gold);
        margin-bottom:24px;
        display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
      ">
        <i data-feather="layers" width="14" height="14"></i>
