            <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">
              Behavioral AI, Not Signals
            </div>
            <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
              KAIZEN never tells you what to trade. It tells you whether you followed your
              own process and identifies exactly where and why your discipline breaks down
              across sessions. The intelligence grows with every entry you log.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="
          background:var(--bg-card);
          border:1px solid var(--border);
          padding:28px;
          display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;
        ">
          <div style="
            width:40px;height:40px;min-width:40px;
            border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
            background:rgba(201,168,76,0.05);
            display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
            color:var(--gold);
          ">
            <i data-feather="heart" width="18" height="18"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">
              Psychology, Not Just Trade Analysis
            </div>
            <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
              A dedicated Psychology Session space lets you talk to KAIZEN AI about your
              mindset, fear of pulling the trigger, financial pressure, or self-doubt —
              not tied to any specific trade. Discipline failures are often rooted in
              psychology that never shows up in a trade log.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="
          background:var(--bg-card);
          border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.18);
          padding:28px;
          display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;
        ">
          <div style="
            width:40px;height:40px;min-width:40px;
            border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
            background:rgba(201,168,76,0.08);
            display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
            color:var(--gold);
          ">
            <i data-feather="link" width="18" height="18"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">
              Dual On-Chain Reputation
            </div>
            <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
              KAIZEN is the first trading discipline platform with dual blockchain
              reputation. Zero Authority DAO on Stacks records your discipline milestones
              and trading credentials. Mantle blockchain records KAIZEN AI's own performance from 
              every score change, pattern detected, and milestone achieved permanently and
              verifiably. Two chains. Two angles. One complete picture.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="
          background:var(--bg-card);
          border:1px solid var(--border);
          padding:28px;
          display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;
        ">
          <div style="
            width:40px;height:40px;min-width:40px;
            border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
            background:rgba(201,168,76,0.05);
            display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
            color:var(--gold);
          ">
            <i data-feather="user" width="18" height="18"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">
              Built From Real Experience
            </div>
            <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;margin:0;">
              KAIZEN was conceived from direct, personal experience with the exact discipline
              challenges it was built to solve. The multi-timeframe liquidity strategy that
              KAIZEN was designed to support is the same strategy the founder trades.
              This is not a tool built by observers. It was built from the inside.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ON-CHAIN SECTION -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:48px;">
