          </p>
          <a href="https://zeroauthoritydao.com/creators" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="
            font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
            font-size:0.6rem;
            letter-spacing:0.1em;
            text-transform:uppercase;
            color:var(--gold);
            text-decoration:none;
            display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
          ">
            Visit ZA DAO
            <i data-feather="external-link" width="11" height="11"></i>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div style="
          background:var(--bg-card);
          border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.15);
          padding:28px;
          position:relative;
          overflow:hidden;
        ">
          <div style="
            position:absolute;top:0;right:0;
            width:80px;height:80px;
            background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(59,130,246,0.06),transparent 70%);
          "></div>
          <div style="
            font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
            font-size:0.55rem;
            letter-spacing:0.15em;
            text-transform:uppercase;
            color:var(--ash);
            margin-bottom:12px;
          ">Mantle Blockchain</div>
          <div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:10px;">
            AI Performance Benchmarking
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:16px;">
            Every significant KAIZEN AI output - discipline score changes, behavioral pattern
            detections, and milestone achievements is permanently recorded on Mantle
            blockchain. The first verifiable, tamper-proof performance record for a
            behavioral trading AI agent.
          </p>
          <a href="https://explorer.sepolia.mantle.xyz" target="_blank" style="
            font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
            font-size:0.6rem;
            letter-spacing:0.1em;
            text-transform:uppercase;
            color:var(--blue);
            text-decoration:none;
            display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
          ">
            View on Mantle Explorer
            <i data-feather="external-link" width="11" height="11"></i>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MISSION STATEMENT -->
    <div style="
      border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,168,76,0.04),rgba(59,130,246,0.02));
      padding:48px 40px;
      text-align:center;
    ">
      <div style="
        font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
        font-size:4rem;
        color:rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
        line-height:1;
        margin-bottom:16px;
      "></div>
      <blockquote style="
        font-size:1.2rem;
        font-style:italic;
        color:var(--text-primary);
        line-height:1.7;
        margin:0 0 20px;
        max-width:500px;
        margin-left:auto;
        margin-right:auto;
      ">
        "KAIZEN scores discipline, not P&L because consistent process
        is what creates consistent profit."
      </blockquote>
      <div style="
        font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
        font-size:0.62rem;
        letter-spacing:0.15em;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        color:var(--ash);
      ">Trade Better. Every Day.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:48px;">
      <a href="/auth/register" class="btn-primary" style="padding:16px 48px;font-size:0.9rem;">
        Start Building Your Discipline Record
      </a>
      <p style="
        font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
        font-size:0.6rem;
        letter-spacing:0.1em;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        color:var(--ash);
        margin-top:12px;
      ">Free to start · No credit card · No signals</p>
    </div>

  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
  <script>feather.replace();</script>
</body>
</html>
